### Requisições de exemplo do MS2 (IntelliJ HTTP Client).
### Troque o e-mail e a senha por os de um usuário já cadastrado no MS1 (por exemplo, do CSV de exemplo)
### e o {{userId}} pelo id dele (veja em POST /users/authenticate).

@ms1 = http://localhost:8081
@ms2 = http://localhost:8082
@email = maria.silva@example.com
@password = Senha@123
@userId = COLE-AQUI-O-UUID-DO-USUARIO

### MS1: descobrir o id do usuário
POST {{ms1}}/users/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Saldo e limites (vindos do MockAPI)
GET {{ms2}}/accounts/{{userId}}/balance
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}

### Depósito
POST {{ms2}}/transactions
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "DEPOSIT",
  "amount": 3000.00,
  "description": "Salario"
}

### Compra aprovada
POST {{ms2}}/transactions
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PURCHASE",
  "amount": 89.90,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "description": "Mercado do mes"
}

### Retirada acima do saldo (volta REJECTED com o motivo)
POST {{ms2}}/transactions
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "WITHDRAWAL",
  "amount": 999999.00,
  "description": "Saque grande"
}

### Transferência (informe o id de outro usuário)
POST {{ms2}}/transactions
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TRANSFER",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "destinationUserId": "COLE-AQUI-O-UUID-DO-DESTINATARIO",
  "description": "Pix"
}

### Consultar uma transação (com valores convertidos)
GET {{ms2}}/transactions/COLE-AQUI-O-ID-DA-TRANSACAO
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}

### Listar as minhas transações do mês, só compras
GET {{ms2}}/transactions?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30&type=PURCHASE
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}

### Análise de despesas (sem datas = mês atual)
GET {{ms2}}/expenses/summary
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}

### Relatório CSV
GET {{ms2}}/transactions/report?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}

### Sem credenciais (deve dar 401)
GET {{ms2}}/transactions
